@@ PendulumData — a real recording for PendulumG and SensorPeriod: the swing
@@ of a pendulum whose bob is a phone, measured by its gyroscope with the
@@ experiment Pendulum of the application phyphox, on 2026-11-23. The
@@ 500 last samples of the recording, 9.5 s at 52.7 Hz: the time in seconds,
@@ from the first sample, then the rotation rates about the x, y and z axes
@@ of the phone, in rad/s, rounded to four decimals. The length of the
@@ pendulum, from the pivot to the centre of the phone: 56.0 cm, to 1.0 cm.
@@ Returns the array of the rows [ t ωx ωy ωz ].
@@ Author & design          : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
